@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create a class
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Class 6 - Morning Shift", "totalSeats": 120 }

### Create a class - invalid (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "totalSeats": 0 }

### List classes with seat breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes

### Get one class (replace the id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
